WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:38.720
Somehow or other,
we made it back to space.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.430
But that guy Madchar and the others...

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:44.630
didn't think people like us
belonged on the Nahel Argama.

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:48.610
That made us kind of mad, so we
took the Nahel Argama for ourselves.

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:50.190
All right!

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:54.490
Still... does this mean we have to
carry on the fight on our own now?

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.030
THE IRON WALL OF JAMRU FIN

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:17.300
This is the last container
of dummy asteroids.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.800
Good job!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.760
Deputy Captain, we've finished
loading in the supplies.

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:24.140
Deputy Captain Emary?

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:26.890
He loves me. He loves me not.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:29.350
He loves me. He loves me not.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:31.910
He loves me!

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:34.330
C-Captain Bright!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.570
Here's that message.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:38.280
Right!

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:41.540
Also, my personal message is in here.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:44.660
You really need to go?

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.500
If the Nahel Argama is to
continue receiving supplies,

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.170
I need to make it happen.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:52.170
But if the ship doesn't have its captain...

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.170
That's why I'm sending you.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:58.680
We've completed the loading!
Captain, if you could hurry, please.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.140
- Where are Shinta and Qum?
- Already aboard.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:04.140
We have a map of the
deployment of forces at Side 3.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.270
See you, Emary.

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:05.850
Captain!

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.850
Deputy Captain! We have to catch
up with the Nahel Argama!

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:10.150
Just us?

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:13.940
Of course! There was no point
visiting to Granada otherwise!

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:14.940
Deputy Captain!

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:16.380
R-Right.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.160
Understood.
I'll get on it, at once.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.760
E camera, receiving video.

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:40.430
G camera, commencing input.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:41.760
Iino, how are you doing?

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.970
I'm doing it right now!
This should go like this, so...

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:46.060
You're too slow.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.560
The captain should sit
and be quiet, you know?

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:49.430
But...!

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:50.940
Whatever. Let him be.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.440
We have video!

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:55.570
Nice job!
Torres, magnify G camera.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:56.740
Aye, aye!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.860
Collating data.
It's the Side 3 colony cluster.

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:03.030
Is that all?

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:03.700
Judau!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:07.540
There are no enemies here!
So let's get going to Side 3!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.540
No!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.540
The enemy has to be hiding
around here someplace.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:14.040
And we don't know how the Neo Zeon
are deployed at Side 3!

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.750
Do you mean we'll get
that info if we wait here?

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:21.050
Sure we will. Captain Bright
will get it to us, somehow.

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.340
Just keep up the surveillance here, Torres.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.470
Hey!

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:27.560
How about maybe asking
the captain to make a decision?!

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.930
I'm just saving time!

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:30.980
- You're what?!
- Wanna fight?!

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.980
STOP IT!

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:37.240
Right. If we start fighting now,
Leina will yell at me.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.150
L-Leina...?

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:43.460
We need to end this war
so I can go see her again.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.200
Judau...

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.830
Iino, stay on watch!

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.160
R-Right!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:52.800
Don't you think maybe
Judau needs a rest?

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:55.330
He's just a little tired.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:56.750
I hope that's all it is.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.170
Beecha, maintaining
watch for enemies!

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:02.840
Please. There's junk blocking
the port-side camera.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.980
- Spool it out further.
- Aye, sir!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:18.860
It's there. It's not.
It's there. It's not. It's there.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.230
You should just let the navigator
handle the course calculations.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.150
Deputy Captain!

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:26.250
Assessing a course isn't fortune-telling!

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.530
You think those kids are just
going to wait around for us?

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:31.660
The Argama has Torres
and Keithron aboard, too!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:34.120
But not Captain Bright!

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.250
Even Captain Bright thinks
they're in this airspace!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.340
Oh, I know! We should just
head into the shoal zone!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.880
She's hopeless.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.550
But what if something...

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:47.640
should happen to me before
I can even get married...?

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.350
I know!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.240
Ready a signal flare.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:13.160
At this speed, we'll reach the
Endra 10 minutes ahead of schedule.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:16.290
The Jamru Fins are
faster than we expected.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.330
With these new designs
and us as the pilots,

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.540
it'll be a piece of cake
to defeat the Argama!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.050
Another promotion
should be coming soon.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.020
Along with more
ladies to chase us!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.720
Entering shoal zone.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:28.340
Before we reach the Endra II,
let's shake down these things.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.440
Roger!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.440
That's nice timing, Del, Dune.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.240
Danny, look!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.910
That light... the Argama?
Let's go!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.750
You fired a signal flare?!
What if the enemy spots it?!

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.540
At least the enemy's further
away than the Nahel Argama!

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:00.000
Even so...!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.550
If the Argama's in this airspace,
we'll contact them!

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:07.340
Deputy Captain, flying objects,
closing from our port-side.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:08.430
See?

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.840
No matching data!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:10.970
Oh, no!

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:13.890
Deputy Captain,
sound battle stations, quick!

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:15.610
Yes... right!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:24.900
Isn't the Mega Rider ready yet?

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.940
You wouldn't normally fire
a signal flare around here!

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.200
They've been spotted by the enemy!

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.660
Let's go!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:40.040
I'm so glad they deployed
all these dummy asteroids!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.170
Let's show them just
what we're capable of!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.300
Right!

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:46.840
The enemy's approach
speed hasn't dropped!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.550
With all these dummy asteroids?!
Set up a barrage, at once!

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.480
We can't, with all these
dummy asteroids around us!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.350
Die, dock ship!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.030
Captain Bright!

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.230
We're near the point where that
signal flare went off.

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:09.240
Enemies!

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:11.040
Huh? There!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.410
Figures.
Darn you, Miss Emary...!

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.410
We may not make
it at this rate.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:19.540
Elle!

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.710
What?

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.290
Fire in the direction
I tell you to!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.670
From here?!

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:27.350
l don't want to see the
La Vie en Rose burn! Okay, now...

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.880
That's it! We've got a
firing line to them! Shoot!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.520
If you say so!

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.240
Did we get them?!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:57.620
We still don't know
if we hit anything!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.670
Hey, this is Judau
you're talking to!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.870
You okay, Danny?!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.920
They hit my booster.
Let's withdraw!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.380
But we've got 'em on the ropes!

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.420
Our primary target is the Argama, right?

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:10.680
We can still make our
appointment with Mashymre. Let's go!

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:14.260
Throw the small fry back.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:17.560
Beating the Argama is what'll
get us our promotions.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:24.560
Yes!
They're running for it!

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.990
We're saved, Deputy Captain!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.410
The Zeta doesn't have
any data on those things?

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:40.120
New models. If they
were headed for Side 3, then...

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.710
They were codeveloped
by the old Zeon engineers?

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.920
They looked tough, too.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.630
The reason I've
gathered you all here...

00:09:56.630 --> 00:10:00.310
is to deliver a message
from Captain Bright.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:04.520
This looks like a
job for the captain!

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:07.150
Let's see...
here we go!

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:13.230
Okay. "The presence of Neo Zeon
in Side 3 is a threat to the AEUG.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:16.820
Your mission is to
defeat Neo Zeon.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.680
We have every confidence that,
as Newtypes, you can accomplish this.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:24.500
Furthermore, in the event you
do not carry out these orders,

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.250
you will be hunted down
and eliminated as rebels...

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:30.230
by both the AEUG and
the Earth Federation."

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:33.020
What? Is this a threat?!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.840
But we're not soldiers!

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.720
Yeah! Right, Judau?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.640
So what?

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:41.430
We were going to head
for Side 3, anyway.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:43.870
We'll get paid for this,
right, Miss Emary?

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:46.690
Of... of course. That's...

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.480
You want money that badly?

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:52.690
We'll have some expenses
when the war's over, right?

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.040
l gotta send Leina
to a good school.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.240
J-Judau... you...

00:10:58.240 --> 00:10:59.240
Beecha!

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:03.660
That's right! You'll need
money to make Leina happy.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:06.050
I say we go with this, right?

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.660
Right!

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:11.180
Captain Bright added a personal
message, too. I'll play it back.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:17.220
Everyone, you're ready to
handle this on your own.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:21.090
You decide on your own.
You fight on your own.

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.930
I believe you're ready
to assert yourselves.

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:27.350
And so, there's really
nothing more I need to say.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:31.230
Judau. Beecha. Iino. Mondo.

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:35.020
Elle. Roux. Keithron. Torres.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.830
Captain Bright!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:41.740
Okay, let's do this!

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.570
Right!

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.030
- We'll do it!
- We'll do it!

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.550
H-Hey! Hold on a sec!
Judau is...

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:50.760
Not another word!
Okay, let's set out for Side 3!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.080
The moment we
clear the shoal zone,

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.550
there's a high probability the
enemy will target us. Understand?

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.260
What the hell...

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:01.560
Something's definitely wrong with Judau!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:27.450
We're here to protect Side 3.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:29.910
We didn't come to be
under your command.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:31.710
Please don't forget that.

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:32.830
Commander Satoh!

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.460
Leave him be, Illia.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:36.900
But, Master Mashymre...

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:40.220
If I can't handle some
old-timer from Side 3,

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.630
...there's no way I can
beat that new Argama.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:46.260
So what if it's new?

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.890
Danny, Del, and Dune,
reporting, sir.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:52.990
So, you're here.
The Jamru 3-D.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:57.150
We didn't bring our three Jamru
Fins here just for show, right?

00:12:57.150 --> 00:13:00.530
I hear you. You'll be participating
in an operation very soon.

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:01.820
Please stand by.

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.070
Aye, sir!

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:06.030
We made contact with an
enemy dock ship in the shoal zone.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.830
The Argama is probably also nearby.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:11.540
They're ahead of things.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.540
They'll be tough to control, too.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:17.960
They're professionals.
They know their place.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:20.930
It's the Dias team that worries me.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.720
Illia, I have an idea.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.560
Sir!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.520
Listen up, Sturm Dias team!

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:35.540
We're passing on the tradition of the
Zeon forces to the Neo Zeon!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:38.320
We won't let Mashymre
run this show as he pleases!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.320
Your booster needs repairs.
Just wait a little longer!

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:51.370
The hell with that!
The Dias team has already left!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.340
I can handle this range
without the booster!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.670
Jamru-1: Danny!

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.300
Jamru-2: Del!

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:02.880
Jamru-3: Dune!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.810
Jamru 3-D, move out!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:24.950
With Lady Haman so near,
everyone's in high spirits.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.410
We're about to
clear the shoal zone.

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.620
Beecha, you'd better prep
to pilot your mobile suit.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.720
The captain needs to stay here!

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:38.580
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:39.920
We've got video on E camera!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:41.290
ID it, fast!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:42.130
Aye, sir!

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:43.880
Message from the Nahel Argama.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.550
Enemy mobile suits, confirmed.
10 units.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:48.050
They seem to have spotted us!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:51.640
Th-That many?!
We don't have enough suits!

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.220
Please calm down.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:56.140
Let's deploy a few dummy
asteroids and open fire.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:15:00.070
R-Right! Prepare for anti-air fire!
Deploy dummy asteroids!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.980
C'mon, Beecha, go out there!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:08.820
I'm captaining this ship!
Let Iino handle the Hyaku Shiki!

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:11.350
Iino's working as
a mechanic right now!

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.420
Double Zeta, moving out!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.590
Mega Rider, moving out.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.800
Zeta Gundam, moving out!

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.670
What? Beams from behind?!

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:26.920
Enemies behind us?!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:29.130
The La Vie en Rose is shooting!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.770
We're launching! Cease fire!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.830
C-Cease fire!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.930
That light was close by.

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.440
Dias team, spread out and
surround the enemy!

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:40.980
You don't need to tell us!

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:44.320
I can tell the enemy's jumpy.
Leave this to us!

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:47.120
Commander Satoh!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:52.450
Shoot! Shoot them!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:54.330
We are!
Why don't you help, too?!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.380
What the hell is the
La Vie en Rose doing?!

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:01.890
They got past me!
There're too many of them!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.210
Mondo, can you go?!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.540
Leave it to me!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.380
Mondo Agake!
Mk. II, moving out!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.770
Piece of cake--
agh! Incoming!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.810
Here they come!

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.190
If I just fly right through the enemy...!

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.730
Take out that mobile suit nearing
the Nahel Argama's bridge!

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:30.240
It's in our blind spot!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.910
We're toast!

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:34.790
YOU'RE MINE!

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.970
What happened? I don't
think Judau or the others did that.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.470
It was Commander Satoh's fault
for refusing to obey us.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.220
Attention, Dias team!

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:57.430
The Argama has shot down
your commander's machine!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:00.580
Take it down!
Avenge your commander!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.060
They got the commander!

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.570
The commander!

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:05.230
The commander!

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.060
Did you see what she just...!

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:10.860
Shut up! It's better for us that
he didn't destroy the Argama!

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:14.250
Danny! Dune!
The Double Zeta's coming!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:20.000
If we take it out, our reputations
will climb even higher! Let's go!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:29.350
Reinforcements?
Is it one of those new models?

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.310
What?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.560
How many are there?!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.070
I'm surrounded!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:54.750
No one can escape the
3-D Three-In-One attack!

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:01.750
Elle! Roux! Judau's in
trouble! Back him up!

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.630
Kinda busy here, too!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.590
Where's Beecha?! He's got
the Hyaku Shiki, hasn't he?!

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.510
You're worried about Judau,
aren't you?! Go back him up!

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:14.720
But, my place is...!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:17.600
- We don't have time for this!
- Enemies to starboard!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.510
They're having a family
squabble now, of all times?!

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:22.490
If only Captain
Bright was here...

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.520
What are you talking
about at a time like this?!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:29.270
That's right! If they go down,
Captain Bright's trust will be betrayed!

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.020
Hail the Nahel Argama!

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.320
Beecha! Just go!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.440
Don't order the captain around!

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:35.820
Beecha, go!

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:37.910
I'll run your bridge, too!

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:40.030
I'm the Argama's captain!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:42.540
And a captain protects his ship!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:44.750
If they can't see you in the
vanguard protecting your ship,

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:47.040
no one will ever
accept you as the captain!

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.210
Y-You don't have
to tell me that!

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.520
l just wanted to be
sure of the situation!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.550
No slacking off while I'm gone!

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:54.670
Aye, aye!

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:58.040
Miss Emary, you're on fire today!
You were like Captain Bright.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:00.340
Of course.
We're one and the same!

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:02.480
To our bow!
That barrage is too light!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:04.980
Man, she gets carried
away so easily.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:12.670
What's happened? The enemy is
suddenly getting more coordinated.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.660
Compared to them, we're...!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.660
The party's over for you!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:26.410
Pretty good, Double Zeta.
You live up to the rumors.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.160
I'm impressed
it's lasted so long.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.130
But...

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:33.430
What?

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.930
Judau! You're taking too
much time with them!

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:39.430
You can't handle these
new models by yourself.

00:19:39.430 --> 00:19:41.220
Aren't you just spacing out there?!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:42.640
My head's on straight!

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.810
One or two,
it doesn't matter!

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.850
What the hell?!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:53.910
These guys are tough!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.740
What are you doing, Judau?!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:59.040
How about you?!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:02.950
I can take these
guys by myself!

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.290
You can't do this alone!

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.210
Wh-What?

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:13.270
Big Brother, I know you
understand! Calm down!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.840
l know, Leina.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.750
Beecha, you idiot!
Get over here!

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:17.970
Right!

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:22.390
Beecha, close your eyes!
I'll predict their moves!

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:24.050
Can you really do that?!

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.640
If I can't, we're both dead!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:27.150
Oh, come on!

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.400
You're ready to die together?!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.310
Don't underestimate us!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.560
Beecha!

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:36.530
Right!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.950
Del!
Dammit, a lucky shot!

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:44.580
There!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.880
Impossible!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.930
The Dias team's morale really fell
with their commander's death.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.890
Maybe we should start over again!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.810
Withdrawal orders?
Del! Dune! Let's go!

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:08.510
But...!

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.360
- Don't talk tough!
- It's pointless to die here!

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.320
This isn't good.
Those mobile suits...

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:27.350
No, armors! They're scary!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:30.040
Yeah. But...

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:33.160
I could've sworn I heard
Leina's voice. What was that?

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.800
Beecha, you heard it, too?
I see.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:38.930
I get it now.

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:45.970
I get it.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.180
I sensed Leina's presence.

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:53.280
That was no ghost or spirit.
It was her living presence!

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:04.360
I saw Commander Satoh hit by the
Argama's beam with my own eyes.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:06.240
That despicable Argama!

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.530
Next time, I swear I'll avenge
Commander Satoh's death!

00:22:09.530 --> 00:22:11.160
Well said!

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.430
You never know what'll
happen on the battlefield.

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:15.290
Is that clear?

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:20.800
If you destroy the Argama under my
command, you will advance quickly.

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:24.420
And you'll be treated much better
than in the old Zeon forces.

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:29.100
Because I am a knight
who is close to Lady Haman.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:48.360
As we approached Side 3,

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:50.410
we rescued a civilian freighter...

00:23:50.410 --> 00:23:52.990
as well as a ship carrying
people from Moon Moon.

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:55.040
We were so busy
we missed seeing...

00:23:55.040 --> 00:23:57.750
mobile suits hidden
aboard the freighter.

00:23:57.750 --> 00:24:00.250
But Mondo shows his stuff!
He's got power!

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:04.020
Rasara's here, so he
has to do his best, right?

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:07.840
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Second Coming of Sarasa."

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.880
Next Time

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.880
THE SECOND COMING OF SARASA

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:10.710
It's scary how many
coincidences pile up here!
